            <ArticleTitle>[Improving the care of postoperative pain in tonsillectomies].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The readjustment of professional practices is a quality approach which forms part of an interdisciplinary approach. This requires coherence between the actions of each player. In this context, a study was carried out at the Liège Christian General Hospital (Belgium) to improve pain treatment for children after a tonsillectomy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
